e are no ordinary slingshots...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_04_s_75","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_04_s_75","text":"Ahem. I've got something for Yukiko too. Here you go.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_04_s_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_04_s_76","text":"I-it's huge...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_04_s_77","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_04_s_77","text":"It's a machine gun.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_04_s_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_04_s_78","text":"A-a machine gun?!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_04_s_79","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_04_s_79","text":"You mean those things in movies that go \"rat-a-tat-tat!\" and fire bullets really, really fast?!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_04_s_80","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_04_s_80","text":"Yep. It's made from lightweight materials, so it shouldn't be too heavy.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_04_s_81","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_04_s_81","text":"Thanks, Commander! I'll do my best to get the hang of it!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_04_s_82","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_04_s_82","text":"To be honest... after coming to this world and seeing the Nikkes fight, I couldn't help thinking they looked really cool.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_04_s_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_04_s_83","text":"But now, if I learn from you and everyone else, I can do it too... right?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_04_s_84","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_04_s_84","text":"All right! I'm gonna turn those D-Shadows into Swiss cheese!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_04_s_85","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_04_s_85","text":"R-right. I'm glad you like it so much.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_04_s_86","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_05_1","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_04_s_86","text":"Well, it's not every day you get to shoot a gun, so I get why everyone's so pumped.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_04_s_87","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_04","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_04_s_87","text":"That's right!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_04_s_88","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_04","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_04_s_88","text":"Huh? But Nao-chan... Wait, what?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_04_s_89","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_04_s_89","text":"I walk over to Aigis, who's looking through another box.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_04_s_90","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_04_s_90","text":"As for Aigis...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_04_s_91","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_04_s_91","text":"*Clack*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_04_s_92","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_03","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_04_s_92","text":"I'm fine. It's been proven that my weapons are effective against the D-Shadows.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_04_s_93","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_04_s_93","text":"Yeah, I figured as much.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_04_s_94","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_05_1","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_04_s_94","text":"Are you sure it's okay to give us these so easily?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_04_s_95","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_05_1","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_04_s_95","text":"Queen and I are one thing, but Yukiko and Teddie aren't used to guns...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_04_s_96","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_05_1","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_04_s_96","text":"Didn't you say they were dangerous before? I mean, I'm glad you're letting us use them, but...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_04_s_97","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_04_s_97","text":"Well, these are unusual circumstances.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_04_s_98","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_04_s_98","text":"And of course I'm not just giving them to you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_04_s_99","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_01_1","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_04_s_99","text":"Then what's the catch?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_04_s_100","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_04_s_100","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_04_s_101","type":"Self","s